{"event_id": "577d8ab2-40fc-4ee2-9ce9-bb6d99440520", "event_type": "assistant_message_completed", "payload": {"citations": [], "content": "**Bug found and fixed.**\n\n**Root cause:** In `prices.py`, `sum_prices` accumulated with a subtraction:\n\n```python\ndef sum_prices(prices):\n    total = 0\n    for price in prices:\n        total -= price   # bug: subtracts instead of adds\n    return total\n```\n\nThis returned the negated sum for normal inputs (e.g. `sum_prices([2, 3, 7])` → `-12`).\n\n**Fix:** Changed `total -= price` to `total += price`. Only `prices.py` was modified; no other files were touched.\n\n**Verification (actual result):** Ran `<REPOSITORY>\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe verify.py` → exit code 0, stdout:\n\n```\nVerification passed\n```\n\nstderr was empty, so all three assertions in `verify.py` (`[2, 3, 7] == 12`, `[] == 0`, `[-1, 4] == 3`) pass.", "model_supplement": "", "tool_calls": []}, "schema_version": 3, "sequence": 39, "session_id": "e01d812d-4fda-416c-94c0-2a1932558c98", "timestamp": "2026-09-23T12:00:20.862730+00:00", "turn_id": "9ff44101-198b-40ed-943b-791c713e2e3e"}
